    whenToUseIt: 'At the start of a regulatory or legislative campaign, before engagement begins. Also useful for mid-campaign reviews and when a legislative process enters a new phase.',
    keyTakeaway: 'A stakeholder map is only as useful as the intelligence that fills it. Blank cells are hypotheses. Completed cells are decisions. The map should drive engagement strategy, not document it after the fact.',
